{
  "meta": {
    "name": "Deal Pipeline Table",
    "tagline": "Full-featured pipeline list with filters, custom cells, totals, row actions, and bulk selection.",
    "description": "Canonical DataTable example. The header tile surfaces pipeline KPIs and a primary 'Log new deal' button that opens a hs-uix FormBuilder in a Modal. Below, a single DataTable presents every deal — searchable across name/company/owner with `fuzzySearch`, filterable by stage (multiselect), owner (multiselect), and segment (select). Custom cells use `$render` to: link the deal name to its record, render a `StatusTag` for stage with pre-computed variant, right-align the amount with a column footer total, show a `ScoreCircle` for win probability, render an avatar+name for owner. `groupBy: 'stage'` collapses rows by pipeline stage with per-stage subtotals. `selectable: true` enables bulk actions (move stage, reassign owner, archive). Per-row 'Edit' opens a modal with another FormBuilder pre-filled from row data. Reach for this whenever the surface is a list of records with mixed value types (currency, dates, status, owner) needing search + filter + per-row actions.",
    "surface": "crm.record.tab",
    "object": "deal"
  },
